+/**
+ * @brief Acquire an array of submission queue events.
+ *
+ * Attempt to acquire @p n SQEs from the RTIO context @p r. If the pool contains
+ * at least @p n free entries the function stores the SQE pointers in @p sqes,
+ * pushes each onto the context's submission queue and returns 0.
+ *
+ * If the pool cannot satisfy the request, the function leaves the pool
+ * unchanged (any partially allocated SQEs are returned to the pool) and returns
+ * -ENOMEM. No SQEs are pushed onto the submission queue on failure, giving
+ * the required all-or-nothing semantics.
+ */
